---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About CMX Labs — Digital Product Studio, Curaçao"
  description="CMX Labs is a digital product studio based in Curaçao. We design, build, and launch software products for entrepreneurs, startups, and businesses."
>

  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-label="About CMX Labs">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">About the Studio</div>
      <h1 class="page-hero-title">
        We build products<br /><em class="hero-accent">that matter.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">
        CMX Labs is a digital product studio based in Willemstad, Cura&ccedil;ao. We work with entrepreneurs, startups, and established businesses to design, build, and launch digital products that solve real problems.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STUDIO INTRO -->
  <section class="about-intro" aria-label="Studio introduction">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-intro-grid">

        <div class="sr">
          <div class="section-label">Who we are</div>
          <h2 class="about-intro-title">
            A product studio that builds from the ground up.
          </h2>
          <p class="about-intro-text">
            CMX Labs was founded with one goal: to close the gap between ideas and real, functioning digital products. We&rsquo;ve seen too many great ideas never get built because the path from vision to product felt too complicated, too expensive, or too risky.
          </p>
          <p class="about-intro-text">
            We handle everything under one roof — strategy, design, and full-stack engineering. From the first wireframe to a product with real users, we&rsquo;re with you through every step.
          </p>
          <p class="about-intro-text">
            Based in Cura&ccedil;ao, we work with clients across the Caribbean and internationally. Small enough to care deeply about every project. Capable enough to build anything you can imagine.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sr">
          <div class="about-stats">
            <div class="about-stat">
              <span class="about-stat-n">4+</span>
              <span class="about-stat-l">Products shipped</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stat">
              <span class="about-stat-n">100%</span>
              <span class="about-stat-l">In-house team</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stat">
              <span class="about-stat-n">0</span>
              <span class="about-stat-l">Handoff gaps</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stat">
              <span class="about-stat-n">∞</span>
              <span class="about-stat-l">Iterations</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CMX PHILOSOPHY -->
  <section class="cmx-section" aria-label="The CMX philosophy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="fc-header sr">
        <div class="section-label">Our philosophy</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">What CMX stands for.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="cmx-cols">
        <div class="cmx-col sr">
          <span class="cmx-letter" aria-hidden="true">C</span>
          <div class="cmx-col-name">Command</div>
          <p class="cmx-col-desc">Every decision is intentional. We lead projects with precision and purpose — no guesswork, no wasted effort.</p>
          <div class="cmx-col-chips"><span>Strategic</span><span>Precise</span><span>Intentional</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cmx-col sr">
          <span class="cmx-letter" aria-hidden="true">M</span>
          <div class="cmx-col-name">Modern</div>
          <p class="cmx-col-desc">We use modern tools, clean code, and thoughtful design. Everything we build is made to last and made to scale.</p>
          <div class="cmx-col-chips"><span>React</span><span>Next.js</span><span>TypeScript</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cmx-col sr">
          <span class="cmx-letter" aria-hidden="true">X</span>
          <div class="cmx-col-name">Xecution</div>
          <p class="cmx-col-desc">Ideas are only as good as their execution. We don&rsquo;t just plan — we build, test, and ship. Every time.</p>
          <div class="cmx-col-chips"><span>Design</span><span>Build</span><span>Ship</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cmx-col cmx-col-labs sr">
          <span class="cmx-letter" aria-hidden="true">Labs</span>
          <div class="cmx-col-name">Where ideas become products</div>
          <p class="cmx-col-desc">We don&rsquo;t just build for clients. We experiment, validate, and build our own products too — staying sharp at the frontier of what&rsquo;s possible.</p>
          <div class="cmx-col-chips"><span>SaaS</span><span>Platforms</span><span>Tools</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OUR APPROACH -->
  <section class="pillars-section" aria-label="Our approach">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header sr">
        <div class="section-label">How we work</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          Built different.<br />By design.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pillars-grid">
        <div class="pillar sr">
          <div class="pillar-icon pillar-icon-purple" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8"/><path d="M12 17v4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-title">Design &amp; Dev together</div>
          <p class="pillar-desc">Design and engineering work in parallel from day one. No handoff, no gaps, no rework. One studio, one process.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar sr">
          <div class="pillar-icon pillar-icon-teal" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-title">Direct communication</div>
          <p class="pillar-desc">You work directly with the people building your product. No account managers, no lost-in-translation briefs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar sr">
          <div class="pillar-icon pillar-icon-orange" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-title">Business thinking</div>
          <p class="pillar-desc">We think about outcomes, not just outputs. We ask why before we ask how — because the right product solves the right problem.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar sr">
          <div class="pillar-icon pillar-icon-lite" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-title">Lean &amp; focused</div>
          <p class="pillar-desc">We scope lean, move fast, and ship what matters first. Less overhead, more momentum. Ideas reach users quickly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOUNDER -->
  <section class="founder-section" aria-label="Founder introduction">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header sr">
        <div class="section-label">The people behind CMX Labs</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Who we are.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="founder-card sr">
        <div class="founder-photo">
          <div class="founder-photo-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <!-- Replace this placeholder with a real photo:
               <img src="/assets/founder-photo.jpg" alt="Founder name" />
          -->
          <span class="founder-photo-label">Founder photo<br />coming soon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="founder-content">
          <div class="founder-role">Founder &amp; Lead Developer</div>
          <!-- Replace "Your Name" with the actual founder name -->
          <h3 class="founder-name">[Founder Name]</h3>
          <p class="founder-bio">
            <!-- Replace with actual founder bio -->
            CMX Labs was built out of a belief that great software should be accessible to businesses of all sizes. With a background in full-stack engineering and product design, [Founder Name] founded CMX Labs to help entrepreneurs in Cura&ccedil;ao and beyond bring serious digital products to life — without the complexity and overhead of a large agency.
          </p>
          <p class="founder-bio">
            When not building products, you&rsquo;ll find [him/her/them] thinking about the intersection of business strategy and technology, and what it means to build something that actually works for the people using it.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" style="margin-top:8px; align-self:flex-start;">
            Get in touch &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="final-cta" aria-label="Work with CMX Labs">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="final-cta-inner sr">
        <div class="section-label">Let&rsquo;s work together</div>
        <h2 class="final-cta-title">Ready to build<br />something real?</h2>
        <p class="final-cta-sub">
          Tell us about your project. We&rsquo;ll help you turn it into a live product.
        </p>
        <div class="final-cta-btns">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-xl btn-magnetic">Start a project &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/work"    class="btn btn-ghost  btn-xl">See our work</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
